{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hequan-e-o191","title":"牧决速扑内侵行军法趣严","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-9d4334a143d4b489da66","label":"正文","text":"牧决速扑内侵行军法趣严","evidence":["hequan-q-391e1b3cf8ea742bf51f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0023","role":"问朝吏何以御之、答不然当及其根柢未深而扑取之此救火贵速之势、敕外趣严、掾史沮议者便行军法","evidence":["hequan-q-391e1b3cf8ea742bf51f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-391e1b3cf8ea742bf51f"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-391e1b3cf8ea742bf51f","source_order":[60,402,0],"order":10681}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0023","name":"钟离牧","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-391e1b3cf8ea742bf51f","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7819a07cf443230b9a47","layer":"original","quote":"牧问朝吏曰：“西蜀倾覆，边境见侵，何以御之？”皆对曰：“今二县山险，诸夷阻兵。不可以军惊扰，惊扰则诸夷盘结；宜以渐安，可遣恩信吏宣教慰劳〖11〗。”牧曰：“不然！外境内侵，诳诱人民；当及其根柢未深而扑取之，此救火贵速之势也。”敕外趣严〖12〗；掾、史沮议者〖13〗，便行军法","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":137,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
